impacket
Usage: python3 ~/tools/impacket/<tool>.py DOMAIN/user:pass@HOST

A suite of ~70 python tools for windows/active-directory work: dump credential
hashes, roast kerberos tickets, relay captured auth, and get code execution on
a host. Each is a separate script; run it through xexec's python tree.

	secretsdump.py DOM/u:p@HOST     dump SAM/NTDS password hashes
	GetUserSPNs.py DOM/u:p -request kerberoast -> crack in john
	GetNPUsers.py DOM/ -no-pass     AS-REP roast (no creds needed)
	ntlmrelayx.py -tf targets       relay captured authentication
	psexec.py DOM/u@HOST            run a command (also wmiexec.py)

For authorised engagements against domains you may test only.

See also: john, python
